---
layout: layouts/main.webc
---

<template webc:type="11ty" 11ty:type="njk">
{% html "meta" %}
<title>Thank You | User Behavior in Design</title>
{% endhtml %}
</template>

<main>
  <div class="thank-you card">
    <picture>
      <source srcset="/assets/thank-you-peeper-wide.png"
        media="(min-width: 997px)" />
      <img class="peeper" src="/assets/thank-you-peeper.png" alt="" />
    </picture>
    <div class="copy">
      <p>
        The survey has ended. Big thanks to over a hundred of you for taking the
        time to submit your response and help with my research!
      </p>
      <p>
        After I have finished writing up my thesis, I will share the detailed
        results and insights of the research here. Stay tuned if you&apos;re curious.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you enjoyed the silly art, you can find more at <a href="https://vukory.art/" target="_blank">Vukory.art</a>
      </p>
      <picture>
        <source srcset="/assets/thank-you-static.gif"
          media="(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)" />
        <img src="/assets/thank-you.gif" alt="Thank you!" width="233" height="39" />
      </picture>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<style>
  main {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: clip;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .thank-you {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--vuko-accent-color);
    max-width: 906px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 1rem;
    gap: 1.5rem;

    p {
      font-family: "Winky Rough", var(--vuko-font);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      letter-spacing: 0.04rem;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }
  }

  .thank-you .copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .peeper {
    width: 247px;
    aspect-ratio: 247 / 218;
  }

  @media (min-width: 997px) {
    .thank-you {
      flex-direction: row-reverse;
      position: relative;
      justify-content: start;
    }

    .thank-you .copy {
      max-width: 60%;
    }

    .peeper {
      width: auto;
      aspect-ratio: 434 / 368;
      position: absolute;
      right: -80px;
      bottom: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
